@startuml togaf-technology
title TOGAF 技术架构（Phase D）- WhatsFeed
skinparam shadowing false

archimate #Application "Web / Admin" as AppWeb <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Mobile" as AppMobile <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "NestJS API" as AppApi <<application-component>>

package "本地开发环境" {
  archimate #Technology "开发机" as DevHost <<technology-node>>
  archimate #Technology "Node.js 22 + pnpm" as NodeRt <<system-software>>
  archimate #Technology "Docker Compose" as Compose <<system-software>>
  archimate #Technology "PostgreSQL 18" as PgDev <<system-software>>
  archimate #Technology "Redis 7" as RedisDev <<system-software>>
}

package "生产目标（计划）" {
  archimate #Technology "静态托管" as Edge <<technology-node>>
  archimate #Technology "容器平台" as Cloud <<technology-node>>
  archimate #Technology "Nest Docker\n0.0.0.0:$PORT" as NestProd <<system-software>>
  archimate #Technology "托管 PostgreSQL" as PgProd <<system-software>>
  archimate #Technology "托管 Redis" as RedisProd <<system-software>>
}

DevHost --> NodeRt : Realization
DevHost --> Compose : Realization
Compose --> PgDev : Realization
Compose --> RedisDev : Realization
NodeRt --> AppApi : Assignment
NodeRt --> AppWeb : Assignment

Cloud --> NestProd : Realization
Cloud --> PgProd : Realization
Cloud --> RedisProd : Realization
NestProd --> AppApi : Assignment
Edge --> AppWeb : Assignment

AppMobile ..> AppApi : Serving

note bottom of Cloud
  生产拓扑为计划态，非已部署证明。
  详见 docs/developer/c4-model/C4-Deployment-Production.puml
end note

@enduml
